WEBVTT

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:08.860
I got a love-call from my teacher saying,

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:12.250
"Kamijou-chan, you're coming to summer school because you're stupid~"

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:15.190
What misfortune...

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:19.360
Well, the weather is nice, so I guess it wouldn't hurt...

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:21.420
to put up my futon and change the atmosphere.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:26.540
The sky is so blue,

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.390
yet my future seems so dark.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:34.260
It just better not start raining...

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:52.900
I'm...

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:55.970
I'm hungry.

00:00:56.310 --> 00:00:57.260
Hello?

00:00:57.260 --> 00:00:58.830
I'm hungry!

00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:05.150
If you'll let me fill up my stomach,

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:06.040
I'd be really happy ~de-

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:08.110
<b>Like hell I can allow that!! </b>

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:10.690
<b><i>Galaxian Explosion!!</i></b>

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:14.250
Geso~

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:18.350
Since I have learned from my mistakes,

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:21.190
I shall not let them happen again.

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:24.760
Here you go!

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:29.650
<b><i>Kihara-kun!!</i></b>

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.270
I've already won the best new seiyuu award and

00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:34.460
now I've won the best co-star award as well!

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:37.180
Now all that's left for me is to be the main protagonist!

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:39.610
Do you understand?!

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:42.520
'The hell you talking about?

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:46.760
Don't get cocky just 'cuz you're young...

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:50.590
I'll fucking crush you!

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:52.740
Ow, I'm sorry.

00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:53.440
My bad,

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:55.350
but this is what the script...

00:01:57.830 --> 00:01:59.660
What? It's in the script?

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:01.990
That doesn't mean shit to me, 'aight?!

00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:05.250
You're just so cute.

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:06.290
And then...

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:08.860
Oh, and I'm going to kil-

00:02:08.860 --> 00:02:10.150
You fucking listening?!

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:13.510
-and so, finally, in the year Showa 61...

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:19.140
I got the awards as well!

00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:20.360
Cool story, bro.

00:02:21.170 --> 00:02:22.140
Here you go!

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:27.330
I decided not to.
I wanted to make a pun on Vento of the Front eating a bento but...

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:35.050
A-are you all right, Himegami?!

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:38.850
W-what is it, should I rub your back?

00:02:42.230 --> 00:02:43.830
What's wrong, Himegami?

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:45.420
N-no, it's nothing!

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:48.340
Your face is red. What happened, Himegami?

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:49.860
Trust me, it's nothing!

00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:50.950
Come on, you're bright red.

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:52.530
What happened, Himegami?

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:54.280
Really, i-it's nothing!

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:57.300
You're bright as a tomato, tell me.

00:02:57.300 --> 00:03:00.240
By the way, my bra today is a front hook.

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:01.520
Say what?!

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:02.690
Any male's dream!

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:06.650
The action-ready, easily accessible front hook?!

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:08.920
Mine is a normal...

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:10.320
Everyone, hear this!

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:12.190
Fukiyose has a front hook on today!

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:14.200
A front-hooked bra, I say!

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:16.800
Huh?!

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:19.290
It's a front hook... Yeaaaaah!!

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:22.100
Yo-Yomikawa-sensei...

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:25.330
not to be rude, but I have to go put things under control!

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:30.570
Hey you! What the heck are you doing?!

00:03:30.570 --> 00:03:33.260
Ah, Komoe-sensei, what kind of bra do you wear?

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:35.080
Front-hook? Back-hook?

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:35.770
I don't wear one.

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:36.930
How nice to only have fools...
I don't wear one.

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:37.370
How nice to only have fools...

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:37.700
I wear a training bra.
How nice to only have fools...

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:38.600
I wear a training bra.

00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:42.300
Really, how nice.

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:44.320
Only to have fools...

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:46.320
Please.

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:53.660
Swinging a beer can over my head...

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:55.580
in front of students is amazing!

00:03:56.820 --> 00:03:59.120
Ah, Himegami-chan, the meat is cooked.

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:00.360
Thanks for the fo-

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:01.160
Meat!

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:05.520
The vegetables are ready!

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:06.700
Thanks for the fo-

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:07.460
Veggies!

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:12.140
Fukiyose-chan, could you beat the eggs, please?

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:17.020
The meat...

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:18.940
I wanted to eat the meat...

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:21.350
Go ahead.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:36.740
"Just what is the fun in playing a game where you spoil your little sister?" asks MISAKA 10032 as she conveys her true feelings.

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:42.150
"On the subject of games, Nei was certainly a superbly cute younger sister,"

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:46.490
replies MISAKA 10039 as she too conveys her genuine thoughts.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:56.560
"Agreed. Nei was not only cute, but also industrious," comments MISAKA 13577 while...

00:04:56.880 --> 00:05:02.330
remembering the past while trying to pull a good line and feeling a painful rush of nostalgia.

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:05.510
"She even had ears,"

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:11.620
"I'm having trouble keeping up with your haphazard train of thought,"

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:16.820
interjects MISAKA 19090 while letting her pained thoughts run their course.

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:23.810
"By the way, aren't you two straying away from the topic of little sister games?"

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:28.200
questions MISAKA 10044 in an interrogative manner.

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:36.160
"You definitely can't tell what they're talking about, right?"

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:43.140
asks MISAKA as MISAKA cheerfully reflects back on past games while devising plans for a new little sister game

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:50.150
I still think Nei is-

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:52.150
G-go ahead.

00:05:53.630 --> 00:05:55.300
These stupid tricks of yours...

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:57.420
I've already seen through them!!

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:01.080
Question.

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:03.960
Innocent people who have nothing to do with this....

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.810
How many do you think there are?

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:13.090
Hmph,

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:15.030
innocent people?

00:06:15.030 --> 00:06:16.070
<b>There are none!</b>

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:29.100
Onee-sama...?

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:31.820
Please.

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:42.900
"I want one of those goggles that  MISAKA 10032 and the other's wear too!" says MISAKA as MISAKA pouts around.

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:48.060
"You mean this?" asks MISAKA as MISAKA attempts to confirm the strange question.

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:57.710
"MISAKA wants that too!" whines MISAKA as MISAKA tries to throw a tantrum like a spoiled child.

00:06:58.070 --> 00:07:07.800
"You may be trying to act cute, but that kind of behavior only annoys me," says MISAKA as MISAKA explains gently.

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:13.080
Also, these are not goggles, it's a Virtual Boy.

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:14.820
Huh?

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:17.230
A Virtual Boy.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:29.310
"An ecstasy of black and red," replies MISAKA 10032 enthusiastically over the product she bought last year.

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:32.320
Please.

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:35.630
Uiharu...

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:41.670
Recently they had that pilgrimage to the Holy Land televised.

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:45.550
I want to make this anime a amazing piece of work and..

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:49.070
carve this it into the history of Japan, no, the world...

00:07:49.390 --> 00:07:54.840
Oh, and to show the entire world the romantic beauty between Onee-sama and I...

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:57.580
and make it last for eternity.

00:07:57.580 --> 00:07:59.280
How should I do this?

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:01.860
Hey, Uiharu.

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:03.740
Are you listening?

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:08.160
Of course I'm listening.

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:10.270
Then it's fine.

00:08:10.270 --> 00:08:12.690
But don't you have any ideas?

00:08:12.690 --> 00:08:15.660
Maybe something like a "lucky lecher" every two minutes?

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:17.380
What?

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:19.880
That's too much of a service and it'd be difficult on my end.

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:24.290
Besides, I don't think that's what this anime is about.

00:08:26.010 --> 00:08:28.220
Now that you mention it, that is true.

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:33.190
Don't you have any other ideas?

00:08:34.150 --> 00:08:38.200
Then how about I get a guitar and sing?

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.120
What do you think?

00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:43.600
Something like that, but that's obviously a parody...

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:45.830
of another musical anime and that wouldn't be acceptable.

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:52.020
Besides, the producer isn't stupid.

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:54.020
He'll recognize it immediately.

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:57.550
Do you think so?

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:02.950
I think that the would take it as a funny joke.

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:11.240
Ah,

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:15.720
if only Saten-san was here with us right now.

00:09:18.630 --> 00:09:20.880
I thought we promised not to say that.

00:09:29.510 --> 00:09:30.360
Here you go!

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:40.890
Being the fourth release, we're running out of things to do.

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:43.690
Touma, you can't say that!

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:46.130
If you think of it, it's been five years since

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:48.400
this studio started Shana-tan!

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:50.450
The people who are writing all this are bound to

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:52.350
start running low on ideas eventually!

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:54.000
You say that, Index,

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:58.310
but those who can write at 100%  even if there's nothing to write about are what we call "pros"!

00:09:58.750 --> 00:10:00.070
Chut up, Chut up!

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:01.380
You're wrong, you're wrong!

00:10:01.380 --> 00:10:02.400
That's not true!

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:05.350
Even if it's hard to write, we don't show it...

00:10:05.350 --> 00:10:08.000
and just do as we're supposed to!

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:11.440
Get bald, get bald!

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:12.920
Touma, lose all your hair!

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:15.510
Feel rejected! Sad! Bald!

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:16.860
All right, all right.

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:20.740
If we do this again, I'll see you then, I guess.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:23.700
Instead, let's talk about Orsola!

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:24.900
'Ey you bastard...
